{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19105240","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1910524001:1":{"text":"あっという間に、他の一族も続々とやって来た。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA95E7F8A3D2EEDB0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あっという間に、他の一族も続々とやって来た。","female":"あっという間に、他の一族も続々とやって来た。","variant_male_record_index":"290854","variant_female_record_index":"290855","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910524002:1":{"text":"来たわよ、マジョルヤ。","source_cn":"摩淖亚，我们应你的召集而来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B1D1CE1FB6AA7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910524003:1":{"text":"皆で一斉に同じ唄を歌い、蒼海の翁と対話を試みるのね？","source_cn":"你要我们一同唱响乐曲，与波涛长者对话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E6500C2202E3E22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910524004:1":{"text":"それが、今の私たちにできる唯一のことだからね。","source_cn":"这是我们唯一能做的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA6E635046D51CE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910524005:1":{"text":"誰もが同胞を失ったことを悲しみ、潮の流れが変わったことに戸惑っている……あなたの気持ちは分かるわ。私も同じだから。","source_cn":"我们为族人的离去而哀恸，为洋流的变动而困惑。我理解你，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4A058719A2642B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_titl